"""Species dataset for the tank-mate site. Hand-written and reviewed; this is the source of truth.

Units: size_cm = typical adult length, tank_l = minimum tank for a proper group of this species
(litres), temp = degC range, ph = range. temperament: peaceful | semi | aggressive.
group = minimum group size (1 = keep singly or as a pair). level: top | mid | bottom | all.
max_prey_cm = tankmates this size or smaller are at risk of being eaten (0 = none beyond fry).
shrimp: no | babies | yes  (whether it eats dwarf shrimp). snails: eats snails?
nipper: fin nipper. longfin: long, slow fins that nippers target. kind: fish | invert | amphibian.
"""

